{"name":"Daybreak","hex":"#7e7597","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Daybreak","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["Surat Al-Falaq (Arabic: سورة الفلق) (Dawn, Daybreak), the 113th Sura of the Qur'an."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Daybreak"}],"entries":[{"title":"Dawn","blocks":[{"text":"Dawn is the time that marks the beginning of twilight before sunrise. It is recognized by the appearance of indirect daylight being scattered in Earth's atmosphere, when the centre of the Sun's disc has reached 18° below the observer's horizon. This morning twilight period will last until sunrise, when direct daylight outshines the diffused light."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/14/Desert_Dawn.jpg/330px-Desert_Dawn.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dawn"},{"title":"Sunrise","blocks":[{"text":"Sunrise is the moment when the upper rim of the Sun appears on the horizon in the morning, at the start of the Sun path. The term can also refer to the entire process of the solar disk crossing the horizon."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ea/Spring_Lake%2C_New_Jersey_Beach_at_Sunrise.jpg/330px-Spring_Lake%2C_New_Jersey_Beach_at_Sunrise.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sunrise"},{"title":"Daybreak (2019 TV series)","blocks":[{"text":"Daybreak is an American post-apocalyptic comedy drama television series created by Brad Peyton and Aron Eli Coleite, very loosely based on the comic series by Brian Ralph. It premiered on October 24, 2019, on Netflix and stars Colin Ford, Alyvia Alyn Lind, Sophie Simnett, Austin Crute, Cody Kearsley, Jeanté Godlock, Gregory Kasyan, Krysta Rodriguez, and Matthew Broderick."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/4/47/Poster_for_Netflix_series_Daybreak.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Daybreak_(2019_TV_series)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a9/New_Dawn_at_La_Silla.jpg/500px-New_Dawn_at_La_Silla.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a9/New_Dawn_at_La_Silla.jpg/1280px-New_Dawn_at_La_Silla.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a9/New_Dawn_at_La_Silla.jpg/500px-New_Dawn_at_La_Silla.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Dawn at La Silla Observatory, Chile[4]","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ANew_Dawn_at_La_Silla.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/18/Amanhecer_nos_Portais.jpg/500px-Amanhecer_nos_Portais.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/18/Amanhecer_nos_Portais.jpg/1280px-Amanhecer_nos_Portais.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/18/Amanhecer_nos_Portais.jpg/500px-Amanhecer_nos_Portais.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Dawn over Serra dos Órgãos National Park, Rio de Janeiro state, Brazil","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAmanhecer_nos_Portais.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/90/L%27Aurore_by_William-Adolphe_Bouguereau_-_BMA.jpg/60px-L%27Aurore_by_William-Adolphe_Bouguereau_-_BMA.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/90/L%27Aurore_by_William-Adolphe_Bouguereau_-_BMA.jpg/120px-L%27Aurore_by_William-Adolphe_Bouguereau_-_BMA.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.o